.TH QSM-PVE-DIRECT-UI 8 "2026-10-20" "QSM Direct" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
qsm-pve-direct-ui \- Inspect or reconcile the guarded PVE web overlay
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qsm-pve-direct-ui {status|reconcile|remove}
.SH DESCRIPTION
The overlay is guarded by reviewed Proxmox template versions and hashes. Unknown templates retain the stock UI. Reconcile and remove change the dpkg diversion and require root.
.SH DOCUMENTATION
See /usr/share/doc/qsm-pve-direct/README.Debian and
.UR https://github.com/rdmitry0911/qsm-rd
the project repository
.UE .
